BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FREE] Celebrating Juneteenth
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T110000
DTSTAMP:20260522T105336Z
UID:370ee0e9f469d7bbac62077a78fdfdc4@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:children,play,toddler,museum,family
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nCost: Fre
 e\\nAges: 0-60 months\\nCategory: Music & Dance\\n\\nCelebrate Freedom and
  Culture this Juneteenth\, a historic day marking freedom and resilience. 
 Children will learn about the significance of Juneteenth through storytel
 ling\, and music and movement.\nCelebrate culture\, community\, and histo
 ry with us and don’t miss this vibrant celebration of freedom and unit
 y. \nTIMES: 11 am &#8211\; Chantrell M. Lewis\n2:30 pm &#8211\; UFirst Ar
 tist\nAbout the play partner: \nJar of Sunshine is an organization dedica
 ted to creating accessibility to the arts\, literacy and wellness. \nDeb
 orah Jane is a writer and producer who helps children discover the joy of 
 storytelling through writing\, rhythm\, and creative expression. As the fo
 under of House of Deborah Jane Studios and the facilitator of UFirst Art
 ist&#8217\;s\, she brings her professional experience in writing and prod
 ucing stories for stage\, film\, and television into playful learning spac
 es where young voices are celebrated. \nUFirst Artist is a creative lear
 ning company that uses writing\, music\, movement\, and storytelling to he
 lp children express themselves with confidence and care for others. Throug
 h playful\, age-appropriate arts experiences\, UFirst Artist nurtures cr
 eativity\, community\, and young voices in spaces where every child is see
 n\, valued\, and encouraged to share their story. \n*Please note programm
 ing lasts 10-30 minutes. \nIncluded in museum admission. Space is limited
 ! Book your tickets now. \n*Members do not require a reservation. \n*E
 vents and dates are subject to change.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretend
 city.org/events/celebrating-juneteenth/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/celebrating-juneteenth/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: Celebrating Juneteenth
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:In 2 hours: Celebrating Juneteenth
TRIGGER:-PT2H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
